OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIsolated mist and fog patches
OL,6,Fclear leaving a dry day with plenty of
OL,7,Fsunshine and light winds. Feeling
OL,8,Frather mild, with temperatures
OL,9,Fslightly average average.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FClear skies and light winds
OL,12,Fovernight, with more mist and fog
OL,13,Fforming by morning across eastern
OL,14,Fcounties. Chillier than Thursday night.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSaturday:FFog and low cloud clear,
OL,17,Flingering in prone spots, but another
OL,18,Fdry day with sunny spells to follow.
OL,19,FWinds remaining light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
